  "source_naming": "H = supplied all-holonomy note; HG = generator control; HD = degree cost; CQ = completed sampled quotient; HDI = typed intake addendum; HCD = continuous common-image descent; CR = original continuous relation completion.",
  "public_derivative_policy": "Every definition and proof is complete. Only nonmathematical private context is omitted from CQ. The H and HCD preambles are moved to the shared wrapper; reversible formula wrapping and prose math typing are recorded under evidence/typography. Sources and their historical review statuses remain available unchanged.",
  "scope_crosswalk": [
    "CQ, HDI and HCD give independently derived overlapping proofs of the sampled completed quotient. Their repetition supports the different exact maps in each note and does not count as separate novelty.",
    "The original H49c inverse exists on each explicitly selected closed strip with d_s<1, with a holomorphic neighborhood. HDI4–8 gives its exact domain and inverse.",
    "HCD retains the full phase-weighted relation cross term. Its original leading coefficient a_h remains in g/h; the monic annihilator is h/a_h, while their generated ideals agree.",
    "CR fixes h and integer k during N tending to infinity. Complete all-k averaged finite-positivity and projection-gap proofs also appear in evidence/current_reviews/parent/continuous_completion_review/INDEPENDENT_CONTINUOUS_COMPLETION_REVIEW.md.",
    "No new mathematical checker, numerical enclosure or Lean run was performed to build this companion. Actual historical and intake execution receipts are included with their own scope."
  ],
